        LOGICAL FUNCTION VAPPLI(RI)
        IMPLICIT INTEGER (A-Z)                                          050660
C VAPPLI- MAIN VERB PROCESSING ROUTINE                                  050670
C                                                                       050680
C DECLARATIONS                                                          050690
C                                                                       050700
